  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "21879890",
      "title": "Adding Route Page Components",
      "lectureOrder": 238,
      "videoOrder": 210,
      "sourceHash": "8fdf5788a3de433ba99f0ddeb4e93d3d779232bc6aee58621dc08c9d9118df4a",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.09,
          "end": 4.43,
          "en": "So let's work on the pages.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.43,
          "end": 5.91,
          "en": "Here in the source folder,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.91,
          "end": 7.96,
          "en": "I'll add a new pages folder,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 7.96,
          "end": 9.44,
          "en": "which will hold the components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 9.44,
          "end": 12.17,
          "en": "that are loaded as pages through routing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 12.17,
          "end": 15.74,
          "en": "It's not a must-do to use a pages folder for that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 15.74,
          "end": 18.18,
          "en": "but I like to set those components apart",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 18.18,
          "end": 19.44,
          "en": "from the other components,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 19.44,
          "end": 21.4,
          "en": "which are not loaded as pages.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 21.4,
          "end": 23.92,
          "en": "That's just personal preference though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 23.92,
          "end": 27.54,
          "en": "And in there, I'll actually add two subfolders.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 27.54,
          "end": 31.9,
          "en": "A coaches subfolder and a requests subfolder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 31.9,
          "end": 35.34,
          "en": "because these are the two main features we have in this app",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 35.34,
          "end": 38.393,
          "en": "and will have different pages for these different features.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 39.56,
          "end": 41.69,
          "en": "And in the pages folder itself,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 41.69,
          "end": 46.04,
          "en": "I'll also add a file, the NotFound.vue component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 46.04,
          "end": 48.49,
          "en": "which will be our Not Found page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 48.49,
          "end": 50.98,
          "en": "In the coaches subfolder,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 50.98,
          "end": 53.45,
          "en": "we can then add all the coach pages",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 53.45,
          "end": 56.106,
          "en": "and that would be the page for all the coaches",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 56.106,
          "end": 58.32,
          "en": "for a specific coach",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 58.32,
          "end": 61.6,
          "en": "and for registering as a coach.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 61.6,
          "end": 63.16,
          "en": "And for requests,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 63.16,
          "end": 65.82,
          "en": "the pages will be the contact page here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 65.82,
          "end": 68.97,
          "en": "and the open requests page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 68.97,
          "end": 71.19,
          "en": "So let's start with the coaches pages.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 71.19,
          "end": 76.19,
          "en": "Here, I wanna have a CoachesList.vue component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 76.35,
          "end": 79.2,
          "en": "CoachDetail.vue component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 79.2,
          "end": 84.2,
          "en": "And a CoachRegistration.vue component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 85.15,
          "end": 89.75,
          "en": "In requests, that would be ContactCoach.vue",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 89.75,
          "end": 94.12,
          "en": "and RequestsReceieved.vue.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 94.12,
          "end": 96.81,
          "en": "Now, obviously, how you name these files,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 96.81,
          "end": 100.5,
          "en": "how you name these components is 100% up to you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 100.5,
          "end": 103.07,
          "en": "You don't have to use the same naming I do here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 103.07,
          "end": 104.95,
          "en": "it's just my personal preference.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 104.95,
          "end": 106.593,
          "en": "Not something you have to use.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 108.42,
          "end": 110.949,
          "en": "Now, all these components are created.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 110.949,
          "end": 113.62,
          "en": "Obviously though, they're all empty.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 113.62,
          "end": 116.52000000000001,
          "en": "Nonetheless, we can wire them up to the router file already",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 116.52000000000001,
          "end": 119.45,
          "en": "and then fill them with live step by step.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 119.45,
          "end": 121.21,
          "en": "So for that here in router.js,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 121.21,
          "end": 123.97,
          "en": "I'm going to import all those page components,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 123.97,
          "end": 126.2,
          "en": "like the CoachDetail component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 126.2,
          "end": 131.2,
          "en": "from ./pages/coaches/CoachDetail.vue",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 131.83,
          "end": 135.13,
          "en": "and well, all the other files as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 135.13,
          "end": 140.13,
          "en": "CoachesList from pages/coaches/CoachesList.vue.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 142.62,
          "end": 144.37,
          "en": "And CoachRegistration",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 145.507,
          "end": 150.507,
          "en": "from the pages/coaches/CoachRegistration.vue file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 152.09,
          "end": 157.09,
          "en": "Import ContactCoach from pages/coaches,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 158.371,
          "end": 162.267,
          "en": "not coaches, sorry, requests/ContactCoach.vue.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 163.78,
          "end": 166.507,
          "en": "And import RequestsReceived",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 170.003,
          "end": 175.003,
          "en": "from ./pages/requests/RequestsReceived.vue.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 175.54,
          "end": 177.9,
          "en": "And last but not least, import NotFound",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 179.61,
          "end": 183.883,
          "en": "from pages/NotFound.vue.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 184.89,
          "end": 186.75,
          "en": "Okay, these are all the components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 186.75,
          "end": 188.79,
          "en": "So now we can wire them up to the routes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 188.79,
          "end": 190.53,
          "en": "For the /coaches route,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 190.53,
          "end": 193.84,
          "en": "we wanna load the CoachesList component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 193.84,
          "end": 197.85,
          "en": "For coaches/:id, that would be the CoachDetail component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 197.85,
          "end": 199.54,
          "en": "For contacting a coach,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 199.54,
          "end": 202.233,
          "en": "that would be the ContactCoach component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 202.233,
          "end": 203.93,
          "en": "For registering, that would be",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 203.93,
          "end": 207.014,
          "en": "the CoachRegistration component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 207.014,
          "end": 210.59,
          "en": "For requests, so for the requests we received,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 210.59,
          "end": 212.96,
          "en": "that would be the RequestsReceived component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 212.96,
          "end": 215.23,
          "en": "And here it's the NotFound component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 215.23,
          "end": 218.18,
          "en": "So now with that, we registered all components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 218.18,
          "end": 220.17000000000002,
          "en": "Now we can fill them with life.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 220.17000000000002,
          "end": 221.674,
          "en": "Before we do that though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 221.674,
          "end": 224.35,
          "en": "we need one other important component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 224.35,
          "end": 226.96,
          "en": "The app component, the main component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 226.96,
          "end": 229.793,
          "en": "that holds all the other components in the end.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 230.71,
          "end": 232.85,
          "en": "So therefore, next to main.js,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 232.85,
          "end": 234.9,
          "en": "I'll add a App.vue file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 234.9,
          "end": 237.22,
          "en": "and this will be, of course, the main entry point",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 237.22,
          "end": 239.49,
          "en": "of our application so to say.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 239.49,
          "end": 242.65,
          "en": "Here, I wanna render my router-view.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 242.65,
          "end": 244.59,
          "en": "So in the template here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 244.59,
          "end": 246.85,
          "en": "I want to output router-view",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 246.85,
          "end": 248.9,
          "en": "so that we tell the view router",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 248.9,
          "end": 252.87,
          "en": "where to render these different components we registered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 252.87,
          "end": 257.87,
          "en": "and it's the App file I wanna import here in main.js.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 257.99,
          "end": 262,
          "en": "So import App from App.vue",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 262,
          "end": 265.88,
          "en": "to load the App here as our main App.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 265.88,
          "end": 267.52,
          "en": "In addition, we of course, also need",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 267.52,
          "end": 269.68,
          "en": "to make this app aware of the router,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 269.68,
          "end": 272.65,
          "en": "so besides importing App.vue here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 272.65,
          "end": 277.65,
          "en": "I'll also import router from ./router.js",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 277.65999999999997,
          "end": 279.74,
          "en": "and store the App here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 281.24,
          "end": 282.36,
          "en": "in a constant",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 282.36,
          "end": 285.03,
          "en": "and on that app, we can then use router",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 285.03,
          "end": 287.54,
          "en": "so that we really use the router in this app.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 287.54,
          "end": 289.57,
          "en": "And now we're done with the routing",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 289.57,
          "end": 291.423,
          "en": "and we're all set to continue.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 292.93,
          "end": 294.74,
          "en": "So with all that out of the way,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 294.74,
          "end": 297.804,
          "en": "now it's time to fill it all with life.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 297.804,
          "end": 299.6,
          "en": "And it's totally up to you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 299.6,
          "end": 302.085,
          "en": "what filling this with life means.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 302.085,
          "end": 305.43,
          "en": "We'll definitely need a couple of different things here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 305.43,
          "end": 306.54,
          "en": "but in the end,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 306.54,
          "end": 310.32,
          "en": "I would say that when we visit just our domain,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 310.32,
          "end": 312.34,
          "en": "we redirect to /coaches,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 312.34,
          "end": 315.36,
          "en": "so that is probably the first page we're going to see",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 315.36,
          "end": 319.57,
          "en": "if we use this page, this application in a normal way.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 319.57,
          "end": 322.89,
          "en": "So maybe we should start with CoachesList,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 322.89,
          "end": 325.633,
          "en": "at least with a very basic first version of it.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
